# Bindable commands that are unbound by default (or rarely reached): each is
# bound explicitly and exercised with plain, counted and edge-case input.
tags: emacs bindable
--- script
readline "> "

=== forward-byte-ascii
tags: forward-byte
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": forward-byte
--- keys
abcd\C-a\C-xf<dump>\C-xf\C-xf<dump>\r

=== forward-byte-utf8-steps-bytes
tags: forward-byte utf8
--- inputrc
"\C-xf": forward-byte
--- keys
äöx\C-a\C-xf<dump>\C-xf<dump>\C-xf\C-xf<dump>\r

